/*---------------------------------------------------------------+
| Function : Keep 30 days worth of Accounting records            |
|                                                                |
| File     : CLNACNT  EXEC                                       |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+
| Version  : 1.1.0                                               |
|                                                                |
| Files    : .                                                   |
|                                                                |
| Called   : CLNACNT  <days> ( <cleanup>                         |
|                                                                |
|            <days> is the no of day you want to keep            |
|            <cleanup> is to run the actual cleanup              |
| Comments : .                                                   |
|                                                                |
| Author   : H.T.Kramer, At_home,                                |
| Created  : 20250726 12:40:32                                   |
| Changes  : .                                                   |
|                                                                |
+---------------------------------------------------------------*/
Parse Upper Arg days . '(' doit .
Parse Source . . myfn myft .
If days='' Then days=30
Say Date('S') Time() 'Starting 'myfn myft
Say Date('S') Time() 'Input: 'days doit
If doit<>'' Then doit='| cms | cons'
            Else doit=''
'PIPE (NAME CLNACNT.EXEC:30 END ?)',
   'cms LISTFILE ACCOUNT $* A (NOH ISODATE',
   '| sort w-2;-1 A',
   '| drop last 'days,
   '| specs ~ERASE~ 1 w1.3 nw',
   '| cons',
   doit
Say Date('S') Time() 'Ending 'myfn myft
Exit
